                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.6363 Import Law/14: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Herrick</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-12T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 12,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Your 60, March 9, 1 p.m. The Department approves your informal
                    representations and desires that you continue to follow developments
                    closely.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
